OL,3,GNEWSA'My 23-year-old son went to bed
OL,4,Aand never woke up'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Bernie Slater said goodnight to
OL,7,Fher son, as she did most evenings, she
OL,8,Fhad no idea it would be the last time
OL,9,Fshe would ever speak to him.
OL,11,FBy 23, Cameron Slater had already
OL,12,Fbought his own home, started a
OL,13,Fsuccessful business and had big plans
OL,14,Ffor the future. Kind, ambitious and
OL,15,Ffull of life, the Coventry City fan
OL,16,Floved football, going to the gym and
OL,17,Fspending time with family and friends,
OL,18,Fhis mother said.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
